  flow: ['The data centre advertises its prefixes over BGP on the Direct Connect transit virtual interface.', 'A Direct Connect gateway associates the connection with the transit gateway.', 'The transit gateway propagates routes to VPC attachments according to its route tables.', 'A Site-to-Site VPN to the same transit gateway advertises the same prefixes with a less preferred path.', 'On-premises DNS forwards <code>aws.internal</code> queries to Resolver inbound endpoints; VPCs forward <code>corp.example</code> queries through outbound endpoints.'],
