  flow: ['Ingestion: documents in S3 are chunked, embedded and written to the vector store. Re-sync when documents change.', 'The user asks a question through the application, which knows who they are.', 'The application queries the knowledge base with a metadata filter for what this user may see.', 'Retrieved passages plus the question form the prompt.', 'Guardrails check the input (prompt attacks, denied topics) and the output (personal data, grounding).', 'The model answers with citations to the source passages.', 'Invocations are logged for audit and evaluation.'],
