  cost: ['Tokens in and out dominate; retrieved context is input tokens.', 'The vector store may have a standing minimum cost.', 'Smaller models, prompt caching and tighter retrieval reduce spend.'],
  failures: [['Answer not supported by sources', 'Grounding check blocks or flags it'], ['Stale index', 'Schedule syncs; show document dates'], ['Prompt injection in a document', 'Guardrails, least-privilege tools, and never executing instructions from retrieved text'], ['Throttling', 'Request quota increases; queue or use cross-Region inference if residency allows']],
